<body>
  <h1>Chocolate Cake</h1>

  <p>
    A simple and delicious chocolate cake that is perfect for any occasion.
  </p>

  <h2>Ingredients</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>2 cups all-purpose flour</li>
    <li>1 cup sugar</li>
    <li>1/2 cup cocoa powder</li>
    <li>2 eggs</li>
    <li>1 cup milk</li>
    <li>1/2 cup butter</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Instructions</h2>

  <ol>
    <li>Preheat the oven to 180°C.</li>
    <li>Mix the flour, sugar, and cocoa powder in a bowl.</li>
    <li>Add the eggs, milk, and butter and mix well.</li>
    <li>Pour the batter into a cake pan.</li>
    <li>Bake for 30 to 35 minutes.</li>
    <li>Allow the cake to cool before serving.</li>
  </ol>

